OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIn the far
OL,6,Fsouth, it will be cloudy with patchy
OL,7,Frain tonight. Elsewhere, dry with
OL,8,Fclear spells. A milder night than
OL,9,FMonday night for most, but chilly
OL,10,Ffurther north with a rural frost
OL,11,Fmainly in Cumbria.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FIt will be cloudy over
OL,14,Fhigher ground at first on Wednesday,
OL,15,Fbut turning brighter for all by the
OL,16,Fafternoon. A colder night ahead with
OL,17,Fwidespread frost.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
