OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FLargely dry with plenty of autumnal
OL,7,Fsunshine throughout. Feeling cold for
OL,8,Fthe time of year with overnight frost
OL,9,Flikely. Generally cloudier late Friday
OL,10,Finto Saturday with the odd shower
OL,11,Fpossible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
